Source landscape: the 2023 Egypt economy/economic-governance universe is dominated by IMF/World Bank/CBE/CAPMAS official material, with strong secondary coverage from Reuters, HRW, Amnesty, EIPR, UNICEF, OECD, and local government archives. I found a mixed set of policy documents, statistical releases, program reviews, budget/legal texts, and rights/impact analyses that cover prosperity, macro stability, capture, wages, distribution, and shock management.  

